msgid "10 more examples of this challenge."
msgstr "這個考驗類型的其他 10 種範例。"

msgid "Are you sure you want to delete %name?"
msgstr "您確定要刪除 %name？"

msgid "Delete"
msgstr "刪除"

msgid "Captcha point %label has been deleted."
msgstr "CAPTCHA 點 %label 已刪除。"

msgid "Are you sure you want to disable the Captcha?"
msgstr "確定要停用 CAPTCHA 嗎？"

msgid "This will disable the captcha."
msgstr "這將停用 CAPTCHA。"

msgid "Disable"
msgstr "停用"

msgid "Captcha point %label has been disabled."
msgstr "CAPTCHA 點 %label 已停用。"

msgid "Are you sure you want to enable the Captcha?"
msgstr "確定要啟用 CAPTCHA 嗎？"

msgid "This will enable the captcha."
msgstr "這將啟用 CAPTCHA。"

msgid "Enable"
msgstr "啟用"

msgid "Captcha point %label has been enabled."
msgstr "CAPTCHA 點 %label 已啟用。"

msgid "Also works with the base form ID."
msgstr "也會使用基本表單 ID。"

msgid "Challenge type"
msgstr "盤查類型"

msgid "The CAPTCHA type to use for this form."
msgstr "要用於此表單的 CAPTCHA 類型。"

msgid "Captcha Point for %form_id form was created."
msgstr "已建立 %form_id 表單的 CAPTCHA 點。"

msgid "Captcha Point for %form_id form was updated."
msgstr "已更新 %form_id 表單的 CAPTCHA 點。"

msgid "Default challenge type"
msgstr "預設的挑戰類型"

msgid "Select the default <em>CAPTCHA Point</em> challenge type. This can be overridden for each <em>CAPTCHA Point</em> individually."
msgstr "選取預設 <em>CAPTCHA 點</em>盤查類型。 這可以個別置換每一個 <em>CAPTCHA 點</em>。"

msgid "Add CAPTCHA challenges on all forms"
msgstr "在所有表單上新增 CAPTCHA 盤查"

msgid "Adds CAPTCHA to all Drupal forms, regardless of the Captcha Points list. Note, that the captcha point <em>default challenge</em> will be used as the challenge type for the created CAPTCHA challenges."
msgstr "將 CAPTCHA 新增至所有 Drupal 表單，不論 Captcha 點清單為何。 請注意，CAPTCHA 點<em>預設盤查</em>將用作所建立 CAPTCHA 盤查的盤查類型。"

msgid "Additionally add CAPTCHA challenges on admin forms"
msgstr "此外，在管理表單上新增 CAPTCHA 盤查"

msgid "Add CAPTCHA administration information to forms"
msgstr "將 CAPTCHA 管理資訊新增至表單"

msgid "This option makes it easy to manage CAPTCHA settings on forms. When enabled, users with the <em>administer CAPTCHA settings</em> permission will see a fieldset with CAPTCHA administration links and informations on all forms, except on administrative pages."
msgstr "此選項讓在表單上管理 CAPTCHA 設定更加輕鬆。 啟用後，具有<em>管理 CAPTCHA 設定</em>許可權的使用者將會在所有表單上看到具有 CAPTCHA 管理鏈結及資訊的欄位集，但在管理頁面上除外。"

msgid "Additionally add administration informations on admin pages"
msgstr "另外在管理頁面上新增管理資訊"

msgid "Typically this isn't needed. In some situations, e.g. in the case of demo sites, it can be useful to allow CAPTCHAs on administrative pages."
msgstr "通常不需要這樣做。 例如：在部分情況下，如果是示範網站，使用此選項可協助在管理頁面上容許 CAPTCHA。"

msgid "Whitelisted IP Addresses"
msgstr "已列入白名單的 IP 位址"

msgid "Enter the IP addresses or IP address ranges you wish to whitelist. All CAPTCHA challenges will be skipped for these IP addresses."
msgstr "輸入您要列入白名單的 IP 位址或 IP 位址範圍。 將跳過這些 IP 位址的所有 CAPTCHA 盤查。"

msgid "Enter one IP-address per row in the format XXX.XXX.XXX.XXX. Alternatively you can also define IP-address ranges per row in the format XXX.XXX.XXX.YYY-XXX.XXX.XXX.ZZZ. No spaces allowed. Your current IP address is %ip_address."
msgstr "每列輸入一個 IP 位址，格式為 XXX.XXX.XXX.XXX。 或者，您也可以使用 XXX.XXX.XXX.YYY-XXX.XXX.XXX.ZZZ。 不容許空格。 您的現行 IP 位址是 %ip_address。"

msgid "CAPTCHA placement caching"
msgstr "CAPTCHA 放置快取"

msgid "For efficiency, the positions of the CAPTCHA elements in each of the configured forms are cached. Most of the time, the structure of a form does not change and it would be a waste to recalculate the positions every time. Occasionally however, the form structure can change (e.g. during site building) and clearing the CAPTCHA placement cache can be required to fix the CAPTCHA placement."
msgstr "基於效率考量，會快取所配置的每一個表單中的 CAPTCHA 元素位置。通常，表單的結構不會變更，因此每次重新計算位置都是一種浪費。不過，表單結構有時可能會變更（例如：在建置網站期間），因此可能需要清除 CAPTCHA 放置快取才能修正 CAPTCHA 放置。"

msgid "Clear the CAPTCHA placement cache"
msgstr "清除 CAPTCHA 放置快取"

msgid "Challenge title"
msgstr "盤查標題"

msgid "Configure the title for the CAPTCHA form. Leave empty to show no title. Default: \"@title_default\""
msgstr "配置 CAPTCHA 表單的標題。 保留空白表示不顯示任何標題。 預設值：\"@title_default\""

msgid "Challenge description"
msgstr "考驗說明"

msgid "Configurable description of the CAPTCHA. Leave empty to show no description. Default: \"@description_default\""
msgstr "CAPTCHA 的可配置說明。 保留空白表示不顯示任何說明。 預設值：\"@description_default\""

msgid "This question is for testing whether or not you are a human visitor and to prevent automated spam submissions."
msgstr "此問題用於測試您是否為真人訪客，並防止自動垃圾郵件提交。"

msgid "Wrong CAPTCHA response error message"
msgstr "錯誤驗證碼回應錯誤訊息"

msgid "Configurable error message that the user gets when it enters an incorrect CAPTCHA answer."
msgstr "使用者輸入不正確的驗證碼回答時收到的可配置錯誤訊息。"

msgid "Define how the response should be processed by default. Note that the modules that provide the actual challenges can override or ignore this."
msgstr "定義回應的預設處理方式。請注意，提供實際盤查的模組可以置換或忽略此預設值。"

msgid "Case sensitive validation: the response has to exactly match the solution."
msgstr "區分大小寫的驗證：回應與解決方案必須完全相符。"

msgid "Case insensitive validation: lowercase/uppercase errors are ignored."
msgstr "不區分大小寫的驗證：忽略小寫/大寫錯誤。"

msgid "Persistence"
msgstr "持續狀態"

msgid "Always add a challenge."
msgstr "每次都要經過考驗。"

msgid "Omit challenges in a multi-step/preview workflow once the user successfully responds to a challenge."
msgstr "使用者順利回應盤查之後，即會在多步驟/預覽工作流程中省略盤查。"

msgid "Omit challenges on a form type once the user successfully responds to a challenge on a form of that type."
msgstr "使用者順利回應某一類型表單上的盤查之後，即會省略該表單類型上的盤查。"

msgid "Omit challenges on all forms once the user successfully responds to any challenge on the site."
msgstr "使用者順利回應網站上的任何盤查之後，即會省略所有表單上的盤查。"

msgid "Define if challenges should be omitted during the rest of a session once the user successfully responds to a challenge."
msgstr "定義在使用者順利回應盤查之後，是否應該在其餘的階段作業中省略盤查。"

msgid "Keep CAPTCHA related counters in the <a href=\":statusreport\">status report</a>. Note that this comes with a performance penalty as updating the counters results in clearing the variable cache."
msgstr "在<a href=\":statusreport\">狀態報告</a>中保留 CAPTCHA 相關計數器。請注意，這會造成效能損失，因為更新計數器會導致清除變數快取。"

msgid "Report information about wrong responses to the log."
msgstr "將錯誤回應的相關資訊報告至日誌。"

msgid "Report information about wrong responses to the <a href=\":dblog\">log</a>."
msgstr "將錯誤回應的相關資訊報告至<a href=\":dblog\">日誌</a>。"

msgid "Save configuration"
msgstr "儲存設定"

msgid "IP address %ip_address is not valid."
msgstr "IP 位址 %ip_address 無效。"

msgid "Lower IP address %ip_address in range %ip_range is not valid."
msgstr "範圍 %ip_range 中的 IP 位址下限 %ip_address 無效。"

msgid "Upper IP address %ip_address in range %ip_range is not valid."
msgstr "範圍 %ip_range 中的 IP 位址上限 %ip_address 無效。"

msgid "Lower and upper IP addresses should be different. Please correct range %ip_range."
msgstr "IP 位址下限和上限應該不同。 請更正範圍 %ip_range。"

msgid "Lower IP can't be greater than upper IP addresses in range. Please correct range %ip_range."
msgstr "IP 下限不能大於範圍中的 IP 位址上限。 請更正範圍 %ip_range。"

msgid "The CAPTCHA settings have been saved."
msgstr "CAPTCHA 設定已儲存。"

msgid "Cleared the CAPTCHA placement cache."
msgstr "已清除 CAPTCHA 放置快取。"

msgid "The name of the form"
msgstr "表單的名稱"

msgid "The captcha point providing module."
msgstr "提供模組的驗證碼點。"

msgid "The captcha type."
msgstr "驗證碼類型。"

msgid "@type (from module @module)"
msgstr "@type (由模塊 @module)"

